    "notes": "THE TIER A ACTION SET (the L1 material surfaces over the landed primitives only — zero core change): the phase-0 base four (look_around, move, talk, wait) + EIGHT material verbs. THE SEVEN HAULS are DIRECT SETTLES over explicit holders — source to destination in ONE atomic event, the hauler the event's doer (the provenance), no chain: the deferred-realize law (temp-1/D-236) measured in this fixture's own development showed that a chained round (gather to hands, then stock) CANNOT roll — the second verb's gate reads the pre-first state, and under the whole-horizon wait every urgency intent discharges at the wait's end. THE KEEPER'S MEAL rides a STANDING FLOAT (her seeded food and water): the serves consume the float, the ration draw refills it — three independent verbs, no chain, the loop closing through the buffer. The settle-leg solvency gates are lint-required and honest: an insolvent attempt dies softly at the door (intent_rejected), never a negative stock. Every number is v0.1 tunable pack data."
